"<div class=\"seed-heading\"><h3>اختر البذرة</h3><small>محاصيل لكل موسم</small></div><div class=\"season-picker\" aria-label=\"موسم البذور\">{0}</div>": "<div class=\"seed-heading\"><h3>Pick a seed</h3><small>Crops for each season</small></div><div class=\"season-picker\" aria-label=\"Seed season\">{0}</div>",
